# Design system (code-first)

**Source of truth:** `packages/tokens`, `packages/react`, and `docs/`.

## Architecture

```
Figma
  ↓
Foundation / Global          packages/tokens/src/global/
  ↓
Semantic / Alias             packages/tokens/src/semantic/
  ↓
Semantic / Alias             packages/tokens/src/semantic/
  ↓
        ┌──────────────────────┴──────────────────────┐
        ▼                                              ▼
Component Tokens (visual)              Component Spec (Contract Layer)
packages/react/src/tokens/             packages/react/spec/
        │                                              │
        └──────────────────────┬──────────────────────┘
                               ↓
Recipe (visual mapping)        packages/react/src/recipes/
  ↓
React Components             packages/react/src/components/
  ↓
State / Interaction          data-refineui + refineui.css (:hover, :focus-visible, data-state)
  ↓
Web Kit
```

Parallel outputs from token source:

```
Token Source → CSS / Tailwind / TS / dist/spec/*.json
Component Spec → Doctor · MCP · Docs
```

| Layer | Role | Location |
|-------|------|----------|
| **Primitive / Foundation** | Raw palette, spacing, radius, typography, motion, foundation sizes | `packages/tokens/src/global/*.ts` |
| **Semantic** | Meaningful aliases (colors, motion roles, elevation, text roles, focus) | `packages/tokens/src/semantic/*.ts` |
| **Theme / Context** | Per-context resolution (light/dark today; extensible via `ThemeContextKey`) | `semantic/colors.ts`, CSS `[data-theme="dark"]` |
| **Component Spec (Contract Layer)** | Behavior/DOM contracts — anatomy, states, a11y, keyboard, focus, layout (catalog v1.1) | `packages/react/spec/` → `dist/spec/` |
| **Component tokens** | Per-component visual language (appearance/state) | `packages/react/src/tokens/*` |
| **Recipes** | Visual mapping only — references Component Spec | `packages/react/src/recipes/*` |
| **Components** | Shipped UI | `packages/react/src/components/*` |
| **State contract** | pseudo / component / availability / environment | `packages/react/src/contracts/state/` |
| **Docs** | Live previews, API reference, usage | `docs/src/content/docs/` |

## Dependency direction

```
tokens → utilities → react → docs
```

`@refineui/tokens` must not depend on `@refineui/utilities`. Component tokens must not reference Foundation directly — use semantic aliases (`componentSizes` → `foundationSizes`).

## Token package layout (`packages/tokens/src/global/`)

- `colors.ts` — palette primitives
- `fonts.ts`, `typographys.ts` — font families, sizes, weights, line heights, type scale
- `spacings.ts` — sizeNone ~ sizeXXXLarge
- `foundationSizes.ts` — Global/Size steps (aliases for component dimensions)
- `strokeWidths.ts`, `borderRadii.ts`, `shadows.ts`, `motion.ts`, `zIndex.ts`
- `semantic/colors.ts` — `--refineui-color-alias-*` (light/dark)
- `semantic/focus.ts` — focus ring (`:focus-visible` contract)
- `semantic/componentSizes.ts` — component dimension aliases → foundationSizes
- `semantic/interaction.ts` — motion roles (duration, easing, scale)

Build: `bun run build:tokens` → `dist/spec/trace-v2.json`, `token-graph.json`.  
`bun run build:react` → copies `spec/`, generates `token-trace-v2.json`, `contract-index.json`.

## Contract Layer

**Status: catalog (v1.1)** — see `packages/react/spec/README.md`.

- **Source:** `packages/react/spec/manifest.json` + `components/*.json`
- **Doctor:** validates **declared** contracts only (not full WCAG / runtime proof)
- **MCP:** `get_component_spec`, `list_component_specs`, `inspect_token`
- **Docs:** SpecRenderer for all catalog specs; ComponentPreview / TokenInspector still deep pilots

### Spec fields (v1)

`anatomy` · `variants` · `states` · `dom` · `accessibility` · `keyboard` · `focus` · `layout` · `tokens` · `recipe`

### Doctor contract rules (v1)

`component-state-contract` · `accessibility-contract` · `keyboard-contract` · `focus-contract` · `environment-contract` · `layout-contract` · `state-contract` · `motion-contract`

### Coverage

| Surface | Scope |
|---------|--------|
| Spec JSON + SpecRenderer | All components in `manifest.json` |
| Deep a11y / keyboard / focus / environment / layout | Interactive catalog (Doctor-validated) |
| SlotRecipe | alert, accordion, dialog, segmented-control |
| defineRecipe | button, badge, toast, chip |
| TokenInspector | alert, button, accordion, dialog, badge, toast, tabs, chip, tag, segmented-control, switch, checkbox, select, spinner |
| ComponentPreview | alert, button, accordion, dialog, badge, switch, checkbox, tabs, select, toast, spinner, chip, tag, segmented-control |

### Next

1. Remaining TokenInspectors for other `componentColorTokens` (input, radio, link, …)
2. Convert Tooltip physical `left`/`right` panel styles to logical insets where safe

### Intentional physical

See `packages/react/spec/README.md` — PopOver/Resizable centering `-translate-x-1/2`, Tooltip MCP map, Chart tick centering, Drawer/Nav measured transforms. Switch thumb uses CSS `translateX` + `[dir="rtl"]` flip.

## Component token shape

Prefer explicit **appearance** + **states** (hover, pressed, disabled) over flat `*Hover` keys. Pilot: `button.primary`.

## Component rules

- **MUST**: Match existing component patterns in `packages/react` — read a sibling component before adding or changing APIs.
- **MUST**: Use design tokens only for color, spacing, radius, stroke, typography, shadow, z-index, motion. See `tokens-in-components`.
- **MUST**: Composable subcomponent APIs only — no convenience props (`title`, `description`, `items`, `actions`, `onClose`).
- **MUST**: Root elements use `data-refineui`; component states use `data-state` (CSS pseudo states stay in `refineui.css`).
- **MUST NOT**: Invent variants, props, or dimensions that are not reflected in tokens + an existing component pattern.
- **RECOMMENDED**: Add or update `docs/src/content/docs/components/*.mdx` and catalog previews when shipping components.
- **RECOMMENDED**: Define recipes in `packages/react/src/recipes/`; re-export from `style.ts` until migration completes.

## SlotRecipe v1 (visual only)

Canonical API — `defineSlotRecipe({ slots, base, variants, compoundVariants, defaultVariants })`.

| Layer | Owns |
|-------|------|
| **Component Spec** | anatomy, variants, states, accessibility, keyboard, focus, `recipe` ref |
| **SlotRecipe** | slots, base, variants, compoundVariants — Tailwind/class strings via semantic aliases |
| **Component tokens** | `componentColorTokens.*` — trace source for recipe color choices |

Pilot: `alert.recipe.ts` → `Alert/style.ts` re-export → `resolveAlertSlotClasses()`. Recipe must not re-declare a11y/keyboard/focus.

