## Accessibility contracts

- Focus: `:focus-visible` + `--refineui-focus-ring-*` (not `:focus` alone)
- Motion: `prefers-reduced-motion` collapses duration/scale roles in token CSS
- Forced colors: `@media (forced-colors: active)` + system colors (`Highlight`, `CanvasText`, `ButtonBorder`) for Spec `states.environment`
- Layout / RTL: Spec `layout.direction=logical` + `layout.rtl` — prefer `ps`/`pe`/`ms`/`me`/`text-start` over physical left/right
- Doctor: `component-state-contract`, `accessibility-contract`, `keyboard-contract`, `focus-contract`, `environment-contract`, `layout-contract`, `state-contract`, `motion-contract`
